<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Italian-Thai Q2 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Italian-Thai Q2 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     1.61	 vs	     1.36</p>
<p>    Net		    402.45	 vs	   339.12</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     3.19	 vs	     3.47</p>
<p>    Net		    797.06	 vs	   867.81</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited and consolidated. The company's full name is Italian-Thai Development Plc, a construction firm.</p>
